&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;commit 05d41a980b4d4632be318e5cfa5a0bf8820aaadd&lt;br/&gt;
Author: vdpyatkov &amp;lt;vpyatkov@gridgain.com&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
