&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2668&quot; title=&quot;MBean creation fails if cache name contains &amp;#39;:&amp;#39; character&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-2668&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-2668&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
    MBean creation fails if cache name contains &apos;:&apos; character&lt;br/&gt;
