&lt;hr /&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15219961" author="v.pyatkov" created="Thu, 31 Mar 2016 14:48:58 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Add quotation to group (the attribute contains cache name) attribute in MBean class name&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15221143" author="dmagda" created="Fri, 1 Apr 2016 04:38:54 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=v.pyatkov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;v.pyatkov&quot;&gt;v.pyatkov&lt;/a&gt;, thanks for the contribution!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;However I don&apos;t think that we need to wrap a cache&apos;s name with quotes all the time. Please improve your fix and add quotes to the cache name only if an illegal symbol (in terms of MBeans) presents. You can use a regexp for that.&lt;br/&gt;
The rest looks good to me.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;After you&apos;ve improved the fix please re-run only IgniteCacheTestSuite on TC.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15221578" author="v.pyatkov" created="Fri, 1 Apr 2016 11:40:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I add some changes and pass IgniteCacheTestSuite. Now attribute was quoted if it definitely need.&lt;br/&gt;
Please, review these changes again.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15221661" author="dmagda" created="Fri, 1 Apr 2016 13:03:44 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Thanks Vlad. I&apos;ll review your changes in a couple of days and merge them if everything is ok.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15224908" author="dmagda" created="Mon, 4 Apr 2016 19:45:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Reviewed and merged to the master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
